# CHANGELOG

## 20261104

0.1.0: + --version

1. + VERSION
2. ~ switches(): + s.perform(:version), which prints the version and exits.
3. ~ switches(): + s.require_exact = true, since otherwise OptionParser completes -v to --version, and abbreviations of the long switches are refused with it.
4. ~ usage(): + --version.
5. ~ README.md: Options + --version.
6. ~ test/brew-cask-check_test.rb: + --version prints the header's version and exits 0; -h and --help list --version and exit 0; -v, -V and --inst are refused as invalid options and exit 1; none calls brew.
7. ~ brew-cask-check: /0.0.0/0.1.0/

